<title>USA: Florida Progress names Korpan CEO.</title>
<headline>Florida Progress names Korpan CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida Progress Corp said Thursday that Richard Korpan, its president and chief operating officer, will become  chief executive, effective June 1, as planned.</p>
<p>Jack Critchfield, who has been chief executive since 1990, will remain chairman, the company said.  </p>
<p>Korpan will retain his titles as president and chief operating officer of Florida Progress, the company said.</p>
